-- A single cell with ONE RATE-CONTROLLED INJECTOR and nothing else. The PROPS section is
-- 1D_COMP.DATA's verbatim: same three components, same Peng-Robinson data, same SGOF, same
-- surface conditions.
--
-- This is the only fixture in C12 that tests a SURFACE-RATE CONTROL ON A MIXTURE. Everywhere else
-- a rate control is exercised, the stream is pure CO2 (the 1D deck's injector) or the reference
-- does not converge (the ORAT depletion). The injected stream here is 0.5 CO2 / 0.3 methane /
-- 0.2 decane, which genuinely splits at the deck's STCOND, so how many moles "2000 sm3/day"
-- means depends on the surface flash.
--
-- THE CELL IS CLOSED APART FROM THE WELL, which is what makes the comparison unambiguous: the
-- change in what the cell holds IS the injected amount, in moles, with no surface conversion
-- anywhere in the comparison. If the two simulators disagree about how many moles 2000 sm3/day
-- of this mixture is, the cell fills at different rates and the pressure paths separate.
--
-- The BHP limit is 400 bar and is never approached, so the well stays on rate control throughout.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNSPEC
------------------------------------------------------------------------
TITLE
   SINGLE CELL MIXTURE INJECTION

METRIC

TABDIMS
/
OIL
GAS
DIMENS
1 1 1
/

COMPS
3 /

WELLDIMS
1 1 1* 1/

START
  1 'JAN' 2016  /

REGDIMS
1 1 0 0 /

UNIFIN
UNIFOUT
------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRID
------------------------------------------------------------------------
INIT

DXV
100
/
DYV
100
/
DZV
10
/

TOPS
1*0
/

PERMX
1*100
/

PERMY
1*100
/

PERMZ
1*100
/

PORO
1*0.1
/
------------------------------------------------------------------------
EDIT
------------------------------------------------------------------------


------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROPS
------------------------------------------------------------------------

CNAMES
CO2
METHANE
DECANE
/

ROCK
68.9476
0
/


--RTEMP
--150
--/

EOS
PR /

BIC
0
0
0
/

ACF
0.22394
0.01142
0.4884
/
PCRIT
73.773
45.992
21.03
/
TCRIT
304.128
190.564
617.7
/
MW
44.00
16.04
142.28
/

VCRIT
0.09412
0.09863
0.60980
/

SGOF
-- Sg    Krg    Kro    Pcgo
0.0000 0.0000 1.0000 0.0000
0.0500 0.0025 0.9025 0.0000
0.1000 0.0100 0.8100 0.0000
0.1500 0.0225 0.7225 0.0000
0.2000 0.0400 0.6400 0.0000
0.2500 0.0625 0.5625 0.0000
0.3000 0.0900 0.4900 0.0000
0.3500 0.1225 0.4225 0.0000
0.4000 0.1600 0.3600 0.0000
0.4500 0.2025 0.3025 0.0000
0.5000 0.2500 0.2500 0.0000
0.5500 0.3025 0.2025 0.0000
0.6000 0.3600 0.1600 0.0000
0.6500 0.4225 0.1225 0.0000
0.7000 0.4900 0.0900 0.0000
0.7500 0.5625 0.0625 0.0000
0.8000 0.6400 0.0400 0.0000
0.8500 0.7225 0.0225 0.0000
0.9000 0.8100 0.0100 0.0000
0.9500 0.9025 0.0025 0.0000
1.0000 1.0000 0.0000 0.0000
/


STCOND
15.0 1.0 /


------------------------------------------------------------------------
SOLUTION
------------------------------------------------------------------------


PRESSURE
1*150.
/
SGAS
1*0.
/
TEMPI
1*150
/
ZMF
1*0.1
1*0.3
1*0.6
/
RPTRST
BASIC=2
PRESSURE
SGAS
SOIL
PSAT
XMF
YMF
ZMF
DENO
DENG
VGAS
VOIL
/

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SUMMARY
------------------------------------------------------------------------
ALL

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCHEDULE
------------------------------------------------------------------------

RPTRST
BASIC = 2
PRESSURE
SGAS
SOIL
PSAT
XMF
YMF
ZMF
DENO
DENG
VGAS
VOIL
/

WELSPECS
INJ FIELD 1 1 1* GAS /
/
COMPDAT
INJ 1 1 1 1 OPEN 2* 0.0151 /
/
WCONINJE
INJ GAS OPEN RATE 2000 1* 400 /
/

WELLSTRE
ISTR 0.5 0.3 0.2 /
/

WINJGAS
INJ STREAM ISTR /
/

TSTEP
    20*1.0
/
END
